00:03:00,600 --> 00:03:01,760
You think...

54
00:03:01,760 --> 00:03:04,560
How do you love lol

55
00:03:05,000 --> 00:03:05,940
I guess...

56
00:03:06,680 --> 00:03:07,580
Don't let me tell you...

57
00:03:07,580 --> 00:03:09,800
trying to fight always lots...

58
