Thank you very much.

60
00:03:40,540 --> 00:03:48,720
The boy I fell in love with is really weak.

61
00:03:51,200 --> 00:03:53,500
And that's not an exaggeration.

62
00:03:55,260 --> 00:04:00,200
Even if the occasion calls for it, he doesn't actually like yelling at people.

63
