84
00:05:23,880 --> 00:05:25,660
Like, she thinks she's too good for us or something.

85
00:05:26,080 --> 00:05:30,200
Well, she has ears, so I'm guessing she knows all the guys have the hots for her.

86
00:05:30,520 --> 00:05:33,180
Oh, and her friend Kono sticks out like a sore thumb.

87
00:05:33,400 --> 00:05:36,620
