89
00:05:37,780 --> 00:05:39,140
I think they're both pretty average.

90
00:05:39,140 --> 00:05:42,320
Ayasaki's a hottie with a body, and you know it!

91
00:05:42,600 --> 00:05:43,300
Not to me.

92
00:05:43,900 --> 00:05:44,880
