185
00:09:32,720 --> 00:09:33,040
Okay.

186
00:09:34,920 --> 00:09:36,100
Hey, would it be cool

187
00:09:36,100 --> 00:09:37,720
if I came over to your place again today?

188
00:09:40,020 --> 00:09:41,360
Sure, but...

189
00:09:42,220 --> 00:09:43,120
just to be clear,

190
00:09:43,120 --> 00:09:44,200
you're coming for the books

191
00:09:44,200 --> 00:09:46,020
and not to spend time with only me, right?

192
00:09:46,520 --> 00:09:46,940
You know,

193
00:09:47,120 --> 00:09:48,700
don't want to get the wrong idea.

194
00:09:53,080 --> 00:09:54,920
This is a series you'll totally be into.

195
00:09:55,420 --> 00:09:56,820
It's long, but...

196
00:09:56,820 --> 00:09:58,300
a very satisfying read.

197
00:09:59,580 --> 00:09:59,920
Neat.

198
00:10:00,260 --> 00:10:00,960
I can't wait.

199
00:10:04,660 --> 00:10:05,120
Um,

200
00:10:05,880 --> 00:10:06,420
Sengoku?

201
00:10:06,840 --> 00:10:07,100
Hmm?

202
00:10:07,100 --> 00:10:08,900
I, uh...

203
00:10:08,900 --> 00:10:10,400
kinda, sorta...

204
00:10:10,400 --> 00:10:11,280
had a question.

205
00:10:13,560 --> 00:10:14,320
Then shoot.

206
00:10:14,960 --> 00:10:16,520
Okay, then...

207
00:10:16,520 --> 00:10:17,320
it's...

208
00:10:17,320 --> 00:10:17,760
hypothetical.

209
00:10:18,500 --> 00:10:18,720
Hmm?

210
00:10:19,260 --> 00:10:20,820
If you knew without a doubt

211
00:10:20,820 --> 00:10:22,180
the world was gonna end tomorrow,

212
00:10:22,500 --> 00:10:23,760
what would you honestly do?

213
00:10:24,320 --> 00:10:24,700
What?

214
00:10:25,800 --> 00:10:26,880
Like in the book?

215
00:10:27,780 --> 00:10:29,400
Well, that inspired it.

216
00:10:30,160 --> 00:10:30,660
Yeah.

217
00:10:30,660 --> 00:10:32,560
I would confess

218
00:10:32,560 --> 00:10:33,400
that I like you.

219
00:10:33,880 --> 00:10:34,240
Uh...

220
00:10:34,240 --> 00:10:37,740
Then I dissolve

221
00:10:37,740 --> 00:10:38,720
into space dust.

222
00:10:39,320 --> 00:10:40,040
The end.

223
00:10:46,540 --> 00:10:47,820
That's supposed to be a joke?

224
00:10:48,940 --> 00:10:49,260
No.

225
00:10:51,480 --> 00:10:52,680
I was serious.

226
00:10:56,780 --> 00:10:58,000
Forget I said anything.

227
00:10:58,000 --> 00:11:03,540
What are you embarrassed for?

228
00:11:03,560 --> 00:11:04,760
Who says that I'm embarrassed?

229
00:11:05,120 --> 00:11:06,060
Because I'm not.

230
00:11:06,540 --> 00:11:08,100
It isn't very nice to lie.

231
00:11:08,260 --> 00:11:09,880
What reason would I have to lie to you?

232
00:11:10,300 --> 00:11:11,260
Just let it go.

233
00:11:11,800 --> 00:11:12,780
Wanna know how I know?

234
00:11:13,000 --> 00:11:14,700
Your face is almost completely red.

235
00:11:15,360 --> 00:11:16,000
Looks cute.

236
00:11:17,020 --> 00:11:18,140
Whatever you say.

237
00:11:18,620 --> 00:11:19,200
Guess what?

238
00:11:20,280 --> 00:11:22,140
You're not alone in feeling that way.

239
00:11:22,360 --> 00:11:23,300
Remy likes you too.

240
00:11:23,300 --> 00:11:23,400
Oh.

241
00:11:23,400 --> 00:11:29,340
The thing is,

242
00:11:30,340 --> 00:11:32,780
I like you a lot, Remy.

243
00:11:35,600 --> 00:11:36,960
Thanks for loaning me this.

244
00:11:37,840 --> 00:11:38,060
Huh!

245
00:11:38,320 --> 00:11:39,860
You read the whole thing in a day?

246
00:11:40,320 --> 00:11:41,680
I finished studying early,

247
00:11:41,940 --> 00:11:43,520
so I had some extra time.

248
00:11:44,060 --> 00:11:44,580
Impressive.

249
00:11:45,160 --> 00:11:46,180
And your thoughts?

250
00:11:46,520 --> 00:11:48,080
Managed to squeeze any tears out?

251
00:11:49,180 --> 00:11:50,600
No, but it was alright.

252
00:11:50,600 --> 00:11:52,640
He was lying.

253
00:11:53,420 --> 00:11:55,480
He cried like a baby while reading it.

254
00:11:56,880 --> 00:11:57,780
When we met,

255
00:11:58,140 --> 00:12:00,140
he didn't let the opinions of others sway him.

256
00:12:01,180 --> 00:12:02,040
I loved him then,

257
00:12:02,340 --> 00:12:03,360
and I love him now.

258
00:12:04,300 --> 00:12:05,300
His weak points,

259
00:12:05,840 --> 00:12:07,100
his inability to lie,

260
00:12:07,780 --> 00:12:08,500
his perseverance,

261
00:12:09,100 --> 00:12:10,920
I love every part of him.

262
00:12:10,920 --> 00:12:17,400
So, um,

263
00:12:17,600 --> 00:12:18,960
