266
00:12:22,000 --> 00:12:23,000
while I was cleaning my room,

267
00:12:23,140 --> 00:12:24,380
and I thought this color

268
00:12:24,380 --> 00:12:25,300
would look good on you.

269
00:12:26,880 --> 00:12:27,600
