271
00:12:31,840 --> 00:12:32,300
Oh, no.

272
00:12:33,300 --> 00:12:34,900
Must resist all temptation.

273
00:12:35,580 --> 00:12:36,980
Think of how mad she'd be.

274
00:12:37,180 --> 00:12:37,500
Okay,

275
00:12:37,780 --> 00:12:38,660
time for the other foot.

276
00:12:38,660 --> 00:12:39,660
But...

277
00:12:39,660 --> 00:12:40,660
But...

278
00:12:40,660 --> 00:12:42,300
Mia Morda,

279
00:12:42,600 --> 00:12:43,860
stop daydreaming

280
00:12:43,860 --> 00:12:44,660
and give me your...

281
00:12:44,660 --> 00:12:56,060
My foot's on your head

282
00:12:56,060 --> 00:12:56,660
